# Copy to .dev.vars for local server-route development. Never commit real values.

# Read by src/pages/api/code-report.json.ts. Both verbs of the endpoint refuse
# without it rather than storing a reversible per-address hash, so a local run
# without this value exercises the fail-closed path and nothing else.
REPORT_SECRET="replace-with-at-least-32-random-bytes"

# Not read by any code today. They are kept, commented, as the record of two
# intended services rather than deleted and rediscovered later — but they are
# named as unread so nobody sets one and believes it is doing something. Move a
# line above this comment on the commit that first reads it.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET="replace-with-local-turnstile-secret"
# ALERT_TOKEN_SECRET="replace-with-at-least-32-random-bytes"
